Şiir Defteri — poem sources

Every poem in poems.txt was taken from Turkish Wikisource (https://tr.wikisource.org) on 2026-10-19 by
tools/siir/build-poems.py and only reformatted (wiki markup removed, stanza breaks kept, spelling as on Wikisource).
All poets died more than 70 years ago (death years from their Kişi: pages on Wikisource), so under Turkish law
(FSEK art. 27: protection ends 70 years after the end of the year of the author's death) the poems are in the
public domain in Türkiye. Translations and pages marked as copyrighted were excluded; scan-based pages were only
used when every transcluded page is proofread. The author notes were written for this app.
Wikisource's own page layout and transcription work is offered under CC BY-SA 4.0: this file credits each page.

